OL,3,GNEWSACoach driver 'thought he'd run
OL,4,Asomeone over'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man accused of causing a pensioner's
OL,7,Fdeath by driving a coach dangerously
OL,8,Foutside a railway station told an
OL,9,Feyewitness "I think I've just run
OL,10,Fsomeone over".
OL,12,FMichael Cockton admits his carelessness
OL,13,Fbehind the wheel of a rail replacement
OL,14,Fbus outside Carlisle station, which led
OL,15,Fto the death of Roger Denwood on 30
OL,16,FNovember 2023.
OL,18,FThe 75-year-old died in hospital on 15
OL,19,FDecember having suffered serious
OL,20,Finjuries when he was hit by the coach
OL,21,Fas it was "suddenly" driven forward for
OL,22,Fseveral seconds by Cockton.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
