OL,3,GNEWSACoach driver 'thought he'd run
OL,4,Asomeone over'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCockton, of St Helens Avenue, Flimby,
OL,7,Fdenies a more serious allegation his
OL,8,Fdriving was dangerous and fell far
OL,9,Fbelow that of a careful and competent
OL,10,Fdriver.
